ns these  are things that i could do right out of  the box and then finally we're in a  mental health crisis in america we know  it we're in it in virginia and so we  just signed a budget that includes  enhanced funding for mental health  support these are things that we went to  work on immediately and i think that's  as a governor what i can do is take  action immediately to deliver results  for virginians we appreciate you thank  you for joining us thank you for coming  back a third time i'll come back again  all right maybe if you have a governor  about 2024 just multiple yeah well i did  want to ask you about that we'll talk  during the commercial break

